# CARTO Basemaps API key — raster tiles have required one since 2026-09-25.
# Request at https://carto.com/basemaps/apikey/ (free, no account, arrives by e-mail).
# Answer "non-commercial" on the form: 5M tile requests/month instead of 1M.
#
# Vite inlines this at BUILD time, so it must also be set in the Vercel project
# environment, not only here. It ends up in the public bundle by design — CARTO's
# Basemap Terms forbid proxying tiles server-side, so restrict the key to
# nycrhythm.scottchen0622.com + localhost at dashboard.basemaps.carto.com instead.
VITE_CARTO_KEY=
